                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0C8F89] hover:text-[#0FA7A0] transition-colors gap-1 group/link">
                                Learn More <span class="transform group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dental Card 3: Dental Implants -->
                    <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col p-5 group">
                        <div class="w-full h-48 rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden mb-5 relative">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598256989800-fe5f95da9787?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400" alt="Dental Implants" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition duration-500">
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-2 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1D2B4F] mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="text-[#0FA7A0]">✦</span> Dental Implants
                                </h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-500 font-light text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
                                    Replace missing teeth permanently with biological osseointegrated titanium posts and premium crowns.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0C8F89] hover:text-[#0FA7A0] transition-colors gap-1 group/link">
                                Learn More <span class="transform group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
